## 3. Mechanics

### Movement / platforming
_(TBD)_ — run, jump, grab-ledge baseline. Open: double-jump? wall-cling?
momentum/weight? Keep tight and readable for eerie precision.

### The dark
- Sight is limited to the light's radius (+ a small personal radius?).
- Glowing fungi / crystals give fixed ambient pockets — safe islands in the dark.
- [ ] Does the unlit player see a faint silhouette, or near-nothing?

### Threat: shadow creatures
- Lurk in darkness, retreat from light. Drive tension and several puzzles.
- [ ] Lethal-on-touch (Limbo-style) vs. grab-and-drag?

### Failure & respawn
_(leaning)_ **shared checkpoints** — if either player dies, the pair respawns
together at the last checkpoint. Fits shared screen, keeps both invested.
- [ ] Instant-death hazards vs. health?

### Input
Local couch → two gamepads assumed. _(TBD — confirm)_

