## 4. The Level — Lightless Caverns (a descent)

One long, escalating level going **downward**. _(draft structure)_
- **Act 1 — The mouth:** dim entry light; teach movement + light handoff + first co-op verbs. Safe-ish.
- **Act 2 — Deep dark:** shadow creatures introduced; light as protection & key; fungi puzzles. Light starts to matter as a resource.
- **Act 3 — The deep:** light scarce/fragile; hardest cooperation tests; reveal of what's down here.
- **Climax / ending:** _(TBD — does the mystery pay off? do they escape / find something / each other?)_

