## 6. Multiplayer / Technical — ✅ Local couch

- ✅ **Local co-op**, two players, one machine.
- **Camera (strong recommendation): shared single screen.** Reinforced by the
  single-light mechanic — players must stay within the light together. Reads
  beautifully in silhouette. (Split-screen only if puzzles need players far
  apart — flag if so.)
- [ ] Engine / tech stack
- [ ] Target platform(s)
- [ ] Control scheme (2 gamepads assumed)

---

## 7. Art & Audio Direction

Direction set by tone (**eerie**) + setting (**lightless caverns**).
- **Visual:** silhouette-forward; the light pool is the composition. Deep blacks,
  cold palette, warm light source for contrast. Bioluminescent fungi as accent
  color. Minimal-to-no on-screen UI.
- **Audio:** sparse cave ambience, dripping, distant movement; sound telegraphs
  shadow creatures. Music swells only at beats. Silence as a tool.
- [ ] Lock palette & reference board
- [ ] Animation feel (weighty & vulnerable vs. nimble)

